<title>JAPAN: Mycal to brief media on merger issue at 0700 GMT.</title>
<headline>Mycal to brief media on merger issue at 0700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese supermarket chain operator Mycal Corp said it would hold a news conference on the issue of a merger at 4.00 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company did not give any further details.</p>
</text>
